 7
The HR department needs a report that displays the ENAME, DEPTNO,
JOB of all employees who work in NEW YORK.
(Nested Sub Query)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------
sql> SELECT ENAME, DEPTNO, JOB
     FROM EMP
     WHERE DEPTNO =
     (
         SELECT DEPTNO
         FROM DEPT
         WHERE LOC='NEW YORK'
     );

Output:
-------

ENAME     DEPTNO   JOB
--------   ------   ----------
CLARK         10    MANAGER
KING          10    PRESIDENT
MILLER        10    CLERK
